cation, holidays, and various leave programs Competitive retirement benefits, including defined contribution plans and voluntary tax-deferred savings options Employee and dependent educational benefits (when applicable) Life insurance coverage Employee discount programs Posting Summary This position serves as an attending for the Division of Hospital Medicine in the Department of Medicine. This Hospitalist position is specifically classified as night shift. Multiple positions to be available to fill. This position will be expected to participate fully in the patient care, teaching, research and service activities of the Department of Medicine and Division of Hospital Medicine in all assigned locations to the satisfaction of the Chair of the Department of Medicine and Division Director of Hospital Medicine as set forth below. The responsibilities include, but are not limited to, those listed below. Position Status Full Time Posting Number 23FA0299 Posting Open Date Posting Close Date Qualifications Minimum Education and Experience MD, or DO, board-certified (or board-eligible) in Internal Medicine. Candidate must possess (or be eligible to apply for a valid NJ medical license, CDS and DEA . Certifications/Licenses Board-certified (or board-eligible) in internal Medicine. Candidate must possess (or be eligible to apply for a valid NJ medical license, CDS and DEA . Required Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities To perform this job successfully, an individual must be able to perform each essential duty satisfactorily. The requirements listed must be representative of the knowledge, skills, minimum education, training, licensure, experience, and/or ability required. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform essential functions. Preferred Qualifications Equipment Utilized Physical Demands and Work Environment Overview Statement Posting Details Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link to Posting https://jobs.rutgers.edu/postin